  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">광물가루 구입<br>약통에 담아 사용<br><br>암석을 이루는 광물(화강암 현무암)<br>조암광물 사진에 실제로 붙여봄<br><br>알게되는 점.<br>1. 암석은 광물로 이루어짐<br>2. 광물엔 어두운 광물과 밝은 광물이 존재함<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9733ceb244e168c59964ccb81192ef3976deadb8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9733ceb244e168c59964ccb81192ef3976deadb8\" data-origin-width=\"3492\" data-origin-height=\"3492\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5f5dca8e8789d53264d393e2a0aa7476308d781\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5f5dca8e8789d53264d393e2a0aa7476308d781\" data-origin-width=\"1598\" data-origin-height=\"2278\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
